        "[4koma] In this whimsical and otherworldly sequence, [SCENE-1] <Alex>, a curious astronaut with a sleek white spacesuit and a reflective helmet, stands on the dusty surface of the moon, gazing at the Earth in the distance. The vast, starry expanse of space stretches endlessly behind him, while his flag, emblazoned with a smiley face, is planted firmly in the lunar soil; [SCENE-2] as <Alex> turns around, he notices a small, round alien with green skin and three eyes peeking out from behind a moon rock. The alien holds a glowing, jelly-like object in its tiny hands, looking both curious and cautious, while <Alex> raises a hand in a friendly wave; [SCENE-3] the alien suddenly tosses the glowing object into the air, and it transforms into a holographic projection of a star map. <Alex> leans in closer, his helmet reflecting the intricate patterns of stars and constellations, while the alien gestures excitedly, pointing at a specific star cluster; [SCENE-4] back at his lunar rover, <Alex> carefully places the glowing object into a compartment, giving the alien a thumbs-up. The alien waves enthusiastically as <Alex> drives off into the horizon, the Earth still shining brightly in the background, and a trail of moon dust rising behind the rover."
